<title>USA: TABLE - JPM Co Q3 net shr $0.23 vs $0.15.</title>
<headline>TABLE - JPM Co Q3 net shr $0.23 vs $0.15.</headline>
<dateline>LEWISBURG, Pa. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended June 30</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.23		    $0.15</p>
<p> Net			  1,744		    1,134</p>
<p> Revs			28,761		   21,869</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,545		    6,227</p>
<p>Nine months ended June 30</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.73		    $0.25</p>
<p> Net			  5,464		    1,658</p>
<p> Revs			85,642		   61,882</p>
<p> Avg			  7,436		    5,193</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - JPM Co took a $0.06-a-share charge in the quarter ended June 30 1997 to buy Denron Inc. Without the charge the company earned $0.29 for the quarter and $0.79 for the nine months ended June 30 1997.</p>
</text>
